WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:08.148
Playful is now the default toolbar. The sketch kit groups
tools by task and gives each one a label.

2
00:00:08.664 --> 00:00:14.958
Start with Rectangle. The selected tool lifts up so you can
see what is ready to draw.

3
00:00:15.463 --> 00:00:19.742
Pick Ellipse from the same group and draw a second shape
beside it.

4
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:27.278
Choose Arrow to connect the shapes. You can still try all
four designs from the toolbar switcher below.
